  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 874aaba05806a514fbb622fab6a31414, type: 3}
  m_Name: KitchenCafeScenarioContentDatabase
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Woi.OfficeFire.KitchenCafe::Woi.OfficeFire.KitchenCafeScenarioContentDatabase
  popupEntries:
  - Id: 1
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Yang\u0131n Riski Alg\u0131land\u0131"
      TurkishBody: "Mutfak alan\u0131nda ola\u011Fand\u0131\u015F\u0131 duman ve
        alev belirtileri var. Alan\u0131 kontrol edin."
      EnglishTitle: Fire Risk Detected
      EnglishBody: Unusual smoke and flame signs were detected in the kitchen area.
        Check the area.
  - Id: 2
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Mutfak Alan\u0131n\u0131 Kontrol Et"
      TurkishBody: "Mutfakta yang\u0131n riski alg\u0131land\u0131. G\xFCvenli \u015Fekilde
        mutfak alan\u0131na ilerleyin."
      EnglishTitle: Check the Kitchen Area
      EnglishBody: A fire risk was detected in the kitchen. Move to the kitchen area
        safely.
  - Id: 3
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Do\u011Fru M\xFCdahaleyi Se\xE7"
      TurkishBody: "Ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda yanl\u0131\u015F m\xFCdahale
        yang\u0131n\u0131 b\xFCy\xFCtebilir. Uygun ekipman\u0131 se\xE7in."
      EnglishTitle: Choose the Correct Response
      EnglishBody: Wrong actions can make oil fires worse. Choose the proper equipment.
  - Id: 4
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Hatal\u0131 M\xFCdahale"
      TurkishBody: "Ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda su kullan\u0131lmaz. Su, yanan
        ya\u011F\u0131n s\u0131\xE7ramas\u0131na ve yang\u0131n\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCmesine
        neden olabilir."
      EnglishTitle: Wrong Action
      EnglishBody: Do not use water on oil fires. Water can spread burning oil and
        intensify the fire.
  - Id: 5
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Hatal\u0131 M\xFCdahale"
      TurkishBody: "Yanan tavay\u0131 ta\u015F\u0131mak ya\u011F\u0131n d\xF6k\xFClmesine
        ve yang\u0131n\u0131n yay\u0131lmas\u0131na neden olabilir."
      EnglishTitle: Wrong Action
      EnglishBody: Moving a burning pan can spill hot oil and spread the fire.
  - Id: 6
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: Dikkat
      TurkishBody: "K\xFC\xE7\xFCk ya\u011F yang\u0131nlar\u0131nda \xF6ncelikli
        y\xF6ntem yang\u0131n battaniyesiyle oksijen temas\u0131n\u0131 kesmektir."
      EnglishTitle: Warning
      EnglishBody: For small oil fires, the preferred method is to cut off oxygen
        using a fire blanket.
  - Id: 7
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Yang\u0131n Battaniyesi"
      TurkishBody: "Battaniyeyi dikkatlice a\xE7\u0131n ve tavay\u0131 tamamen \xF6rtecek
        \u015Fekilde yerle\u015Ftirin."
      EnglishTitle: Fire Blanket
      EnglishBody: Open the blanket carefully and place it so it fully covers the
        pan.
  - Id: 8
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Battaniye Ba\u015Far\u0131s\u0131z"
      TurkishBody: "Battaniye tavay\u0131 tamamen kapatmad\u0131. Yang\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCyor."
      EnglishTitle: Blanket Failed
      EnglishBody: The blanket did not fully cover the pan. The fire is growing.
  - Id: 9
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Do\u011Fru M\xFCdahale"
      TurkishBody: "Battaniye alevin oksijenle temas\u0131n\u0131 kesti. Yang\u0131n
        kontrol alt\u0131na al\u0131n\u0131yor."
      EnglishTitle: Correct Response
      EnglishBody: The blanket cut off the oxygen supply. The fire is being controlled.
  - Id: 10
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Oca\u011F\u0131 Kapat"
      TurkishBody: "Yang\u0131n kontrol alt\u0131na al\u0131nd\u0131. \u015Eimdi
        oca\u011F\u0131n enerji kayna\u011F\u0131n\u0131 kapat\u0131n."
      EnglishTitle: Turn Off the Stove
      EnglishBody: The fire is under control. Now turn off the stove's energy source.
  - Id: 11
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Yang\u0131n Kontrol Alt\u0131nda"
      TurkishBody: "Do\u011Fru m\xFCdahale sayesinde yang\u0131n kontrol alt\u0131na
        al\u0131nd\u0131."
      EnglishTitle: Fire Controlled
      EnglishBody: The fire was controlled thanks to the correct response.
  - Id: 12
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Yang\u0131n B\xFCy\xFCyor"
      TurkishBody: "Yang\u0131n kontrol alt\u0131na al\u0131namad\u0131. Alarm\u0131
        aktive edin ve alan\u0131 tahliye edin."
      EnglishTitle: Fire Is Spreading
      EnglishBody: The fire could not be controlled. Activate the alarm and evacuate
        the area.
  - Id: 13
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Alarm\u0131 Aktive Et"
      TurkishBody: "Yang\u0131n b\xFCy\xFCyor. \xC7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa yak\u0131n
        alarm butonunu kullan\u0131n."
      EnglishTitle: Activate the Alarm
      EnglishBody: The fire is spreading. Use the alarm button near the exit.
  - Id: 14
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: Tahliye Et
      TurkishBody: "Sakin olun ve en yak\u0131n g\xFCvenli \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015Fa
        ilerleyin."
      EnglishTitle: Evacuate
      EnglishBody: Stay calm and move toward the nearest safe exit.
  - Id: 15
    Text:
      TurkishTitle: "Toplanma Alan\u0131na Git"
      TurkishBody: "Binadan \xE7\u0131kt\u0131ktan sonra belirlenen toplanma alan\u0131na
        ilerleyin."
      EnglishTitle: Go to the Assembly Area
      EnglishBody: After leaving the building, proceed to the designated assembly
        area.
